{"id":"leetcode-1832","version":1,"status":"approved","title":"Check if the Sentence Is Pangram","summary":"Determine if a given lowercase string contains every letter of the English alphabet at least once.","statement":"Determine if a given lowercase string contains every letter of the English alphabet at least once.","constraints":["The sentence contains only lowercase English letters.","Return whether every one of the 26 letters occurs at least once."],"topics":["strings","sets"],"prerequisites":[],"signature":{"name":"is_pangram","parameters":[{"name":"sentence","annotation":"str","adapter":"raw","source_parameter":null}],"returns":"bool","return_adapter":"raw","node_policy":"values","result_mode":"return","mutated_parameter":null,"immutable_parameters":[]},"starter_code":"def is_pangram(sentence: str) -> bool:\n    # Write your solution here.\n    pass\n","reference_solution":"def is_pangram(sentence):\n return len(set(sentence))==26\n","brute_force_solution":null,"known_wrong_solutions":["def is_pangram(sentence):\n return len(set(sentence))>=25\n","def is_pangram(sentence):\n return len(set(sentence[:-1]))==26\n"],"target_time_complexity":"O(n)","target_space_complexity":"O(1) alphabet","estimated_minutes":20,"rubric":{"algorithmic_insight":1,"prerequisites":1,"implementation":1,"performance_pressure":0,"edge_cases":0},"hints":["Repeated letters do not matter, so keep only distinct characters.","A lowercase pangram has exactly 26 distinct letters.","Build a set and compare its size with 26.","The alphabet contains 26 allowed symbols; having all of them is equivalent to the set reaching size 26."],"editorial":"The alphabet contains 26 allowed symbols; having all of them is equivalent to the set reaching size 26.","tests":[{"id":"lc-1832-1","arguments":["thequickbrownfoxjumpsoverthelazydog"],"expected":true,"comparator":"exact","visible":true,"explanation":"This sentence contains every lowercase letter.","expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-1832-2","arguments"